1. pull mysql image and run with password is Password, database is
 + docker pull mysql:8
 + docker run -d \
     --name mysql-server \
     -p 3306:3306 \
     -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=Password \
     -e MYSQL_DATABASE=jwtgateway \
     mysql:8
2. Create project with modules:
    + service registry
        dependencies: eureka
    + identity-service (register user/ generate token/ verify token):
        dependencies: security/ web/ eureka client/ data jpa/ jwt/ mysql connector
    + restaurant-service:
        service name: RESTAURANT-SERVICE
        dependencies: web/ eureka client
    + swiggapp (forward controller to restaurant service)
        service name: SWIGGY-APP
        dependencies: web/ euraka client
    + swiggy-gateway:
        dependencies: spring gateway/ web flux, actuor, eureka client
3. jwt token validating in microservice summary

